{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Meal Roulette 是一款以轉盤隨機選餐及每週餐單規劃為主的應用程式，適合忙碌家庭、上班族與經常為晚餐選擇而煩惱的人。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，並提供 30 款入門餐點，讓用戶下載後即可開始使用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-149.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>轉盤選餐與每週規劃</h2>\n<p>Meal Roulette 以轉盤方式隨機挑選餐點，協助用戶快速解決每日晚餐難題；亦可一次完成整個星期的餐單規劃，減少反覆思考的時間。若對結果不感興趣，可再次轉動轉盤，直至找到合適選擇。應用程式提供 30 款入門餐點，下載後即可開始使用，適合忙碌家庭、上班族或經常為三餐安排而煩惱的人。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-148-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-149-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-150-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-151-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-152-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-153-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Meal Roulette</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/meal-roulette/id6827108997?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.728567+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:12:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:59.004251+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.889808+00:00","content_hash":"66a66e030d9c8bdbcf1ee400156d5f0af90684c7490e94028436a280c89adfed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}